# Rituály listing

`/svatebni-ritualy` uses `Sections/ritualy.twig`. Deník has a journal layout; umění a gallery wall.

## Layout

- White page; each ritual sits on a greige band (`.75rem` white gap)
- Featured first entry larger; then alternating photo + copy chapters
- Listing photos: prefer LLM `orientation=landscape` via `Post::getPreferredImage("landscape")`, else best-rated / cover
- Photos reuse `.home-print` shadow + ≤0.5° tilt; native aspect ratio
- Year eyebrow; title = newlywed names from materialize; summary = crafted perex
- Quiet “prohlédnout” cue; scroll reveal via `data-reveal` + `.is-in` (respects reduced motion)
